Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.97,0:01:45.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.23,0:01:48.65,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.65,0:01:50.35,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:01:50.35,0:01:53.97,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.97,0:01:57.22,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.62,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.62,0:02:06.17,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.67,0:02:12.43,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:13.54,0:02:16.98,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.98,0:02:19.68,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 4,0:02:19.68,0:02:23.12,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.12,0:02:26.25,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.64,0:02:30.01,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.01,0:02:33.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.23,0:02:36.54,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.90,0:02:43.23,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.23,0:02:46.67,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.11,0:02:54.38,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.97,0:01:45.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.23,0:01:48.65,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.65,0:01:50.35,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:50.35,0:01:53.97,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.97,0:01:57.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.62,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.62,0:02:06.17,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.67,0:02:12.43,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:13.54,0:02:16.77,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.98,0:02:19.57,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:19.68,0:02:23.12,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.12,0:02:26.25,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.64,0:02:30.01,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.01,0:02:33.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.23,0:02:36.54,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.90,0:02:43.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.23,0:02:46.67,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.11,0:02:54.38,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.97,0:21:16.46,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 4,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.99,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:22.39,0:21:26.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 4,0:21:26.95,0:21:31.55,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.68,0:21:36.90,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.92,0:21:41.98,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.98,0:21:46.06,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.65,0:21:51.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.29,0:21:56.50,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.14,0:22:02.81,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 4,0:22:02.81,0:22:06.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:22:07.63,0:22:12.59,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.28,0:22:17.45,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.97,0:22:26.51,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.97,0:21:16.46,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.99,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:22.39,0:21:26.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 4,0:21:26.95,0:21:31.55,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.68,0:21:36.90,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.92,0:21:41.98,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.98,0:21:46.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.65,0:21:51.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.29,0:21:56.50,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.14,0:22:02.81,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:02.81,0:22:06.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:07.63,0:22:12.59,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.28,0:22:17.45,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.97,0:22:26.51,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.77,0:00:06.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Choose some kind of bread and a drink for tomorrow's breakfast.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:06.69,0:00:07.69,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Aye-aye!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Without running!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.66,0:00:16.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That kid doesn't listen.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.78,0:00:22.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... for a cold, we've got water, sports drinks,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,dairy products, and so on...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.54,0:00:27.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's some food that's easily digestable?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.25,0:00:30.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you want something for tomorrow's breakfast?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cereal or something?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.88,0:00:34.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.77,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did I give it to her?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.81,0:00:45.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.40,0:00:50.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Bacteria from colds is all over the place.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Some people will catch it, some won't. {tweaked}
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you don't have to worry about being the one who passed it on.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.99,0:01:02.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I pick something to bring her too?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:02.62,0:01:03.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.04,0:01:10.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.96,0:01:15.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Put it in the basket.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.51,0:01:21.81,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing in the snacks aisle?!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.73,0:01:29.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! What about breakfast?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.44,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.04,0:03:11.75,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My place is here!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.71,0:03:19.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we're going to go home.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.05,0:03:20.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want your mom fussing over us.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.84,0:03:21.76,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.76,0:03:24.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here. There's food in there, so give it to your mom.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.64,0:03:26.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.10,0:03:27.68,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's {\i1}really{\i0} heavy...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's go, Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.35,0:03:35.06,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Daikichi gave us food!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.44,0:03:37.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen when somebody's talking to you!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.44,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you don't have to...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.74,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.20,0:03:49.66,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry you're always having to look after him...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.66,0:03:53.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, no, I owe you for taking care of Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.63,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How is Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's a lot better now.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She went back to school today. Right?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hello...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:02.09,0:04:05.01,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. I'm glad you're feeling better, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.01,0:04:05.97,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.39,0:04:08.93,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making that rice gruel right now.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.14,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be better soon, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:13.44,0:04:14.31,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.31,0:04:17.27,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's go throw my tooth!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.27,0:04:18.86,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.66,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, be careful.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:24.66,0:04:26.03,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.82,0:04:31.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nitani-san, you may have caught your cold while taking care of Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.96,0:04:35.04,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}We're going to throw it from here!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.71,0:04:36.71,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I meet a lot of people every day.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It's so high up...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.75,0:04:39.75,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I go to the office by train, which is always packed.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.83,0:04:38.71,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm going to throw it on that roof.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.75,0:04:42.30,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way to know who I caught it from.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.72,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.72,0:04:46.51,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:48.30,0:04:49.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.89,0:04:53.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least let me help with Kouki.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:54.35,0:04:55.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's just picking him up from day care...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.31,0:04:59.40,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.94,0:05:03.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, we're going home.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.66,0:05:10.91,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's play video games!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.91,0:05:13.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Next time.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:13.50,0:05:17.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, make sure to help your mom out.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.96,0:05:19.92,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.55,0:05:27.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.43,0:05:31.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The pudding and little drink are from Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.98,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.85,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding is my favorite!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.23,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.45,0:05:55.29,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.87,0:05:58.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're up early... It's Sunday!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.96,0:06:02.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I'm going to practice for the jump rope contest!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.60,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one's wobbly too...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.60,0:06:16.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Brush slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't mess with it!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:20.23,0:06:21.23,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.03,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oww!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.32,0:06:33.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't overdo it too soon.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.29,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.29,0:06:39.33,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to always be taking advantage of your generosity.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's the other way around.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.42,0:06:43.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Really, thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:43.63,0:06:44.67,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised at Kouki...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.67,0:06:49.17,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason, he just can't get that.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.01,0:06:54.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you're jumping too soon.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.93,0:07:00.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When the jump rope swings around, you jump here, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.89,0:07:01.98,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.98,0:07:04.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then you can't move your arms and legs at the same time.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.69,0:07:05.82,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your arms go first, then your legs.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.61,0:07:09.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Try it once slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:09.40,0:07:10.61,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.61,0:07:13.12,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:13.12,0:07:16.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay. Rin, your problem is you swing your arms in too big circles.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.99,0:07:18.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your arms in close like this...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.66,0:07:21.04,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.38,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,You're early, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.92,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.92,0:07:27.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Too much energy this early in the morning...  {tweaked}
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.09,0:07:34.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu-kun is good at it.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.01,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,It's because he's got a big brother.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:36.01,0:07:37.81,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,He'll imitate everything the older one does.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.81,0:07:39.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you going to do it, Sayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:46.40,0:07:49.11,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,This time, she lost one of her upper teeth...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.57,0:07:54.91,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Girls have it rough, even when they're little kids...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.33,0:08:00.83,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan, what kind of container are you using to hold your teeth?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.75,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Did your parents buy you a cute one?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.46,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know about the cases people use
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.00,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,to hold their kids' baby teeth as a keepsake?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.00,0:08:08.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Keepsake?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.50,0:08:11.80,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,They have these cute tiny ones.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.38,Alt,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Tiny!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.63,0:08:11.80,Alt,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Cute!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.80,0:08:12.51,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.51,0:08:15.47,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Mine is a butterfly!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.43,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I bought one for Kouki, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.51,0:08:19.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I bet Rin would love that!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.47,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}We're saving the kids' teeth, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.47,0:08:23.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm such an idiot! I had no idea they had those things!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:25.27,0:08:28.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's been like this ever since I met Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:28.36,0:08:31.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fretting and getting nervous over the littlest things...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.36,0:08:35.53,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, this is for you.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.12,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I drew it at school.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.78,0:08:40.08,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I had to write about someone at home.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.08,0:08:47.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.75,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You put your baby teeth in there when they come out.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.05,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's like a keepsake.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.05,0:08:53.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A keepsake!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:53.09,0:08:56.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun's mother!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.26,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:58.26,0:08:59.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't that Kouki's?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.47,0:09:03.02,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, it's okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.89,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I throw my teeth!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.23,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,...as you can see.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.86,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Until now, I've thrown all my teeth onto the roof.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:08.86,0:09:09.73,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.73,0:09:11.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine, that's fine.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.19,0:09:13.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Throwing them or keeping them, either way works.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.94,0:09:15.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.08,0:09:29.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! I'm going to do my best with this jump rope thing, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.59,0:09:36.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There you go, touching your tooth again...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:36.72,0:09:38.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It'll come out on its own.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.93,0:09:43.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how you look at it, she's going to look like she got punched in the face.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.18,0:09:45.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,As long as she doesn't smile...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.56,0:09:48.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There you go.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good. Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you getting bigger again?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.07,0:10:00.20,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You too, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.03,0:10:02.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starting to get a spare tire...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.79,0:10:04.24,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad & Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.58,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough when you get to be our age.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, I want to stop it right away.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.34,0:10:15.26,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san is doing it boxer-style!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.51,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.51,0:10:19.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's easier on the knees this way.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.26,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.26,0:10:25.18,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Teach me how to do that, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.18,0:10:26.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about it!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.77,0:10:29.85,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Only you get to look cool?!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.85,0:10:32.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,First, learn how to jump rope the normal way!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.36,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.36,0:10:37.69,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.69,0:10:39.61,Main Dialog,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.25,Main Dialog,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Rin-chan, you're so good at doing it backwards!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.75,0:10:52.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, kids are incredible...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.25,0:10:52.79,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:53.79,0:10:56.05,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,They have energy to burn, don't they?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.88,Main Dialog,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.92,0:10:59.51,Alt,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know where they get it from...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.51,Main Dialog,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,One more time!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.81,0:11:09.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Although, adults are incredible, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.60,0:11:10.73,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.27,0:11:16.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think you two already know this, but I'm not Rin's dad.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.48,0:11:20.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We've only been living together for about a year now.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.36,0:11:25.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Until then, I used all my time for myself,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.28,0:11:28.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but once I started living with Rin, my lifestyle suddenly changed.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.33,0:11:32.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys, though, you've been with your kids ever since they were born...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.79,0:11:38.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For me, it's still early days, so it's nothing, really,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.26,0:11:43.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but I've been wondering whether you're okay with not having any
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.09,0:11:45.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so-called "time for yourself"...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.68,0:11:50.39,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.73,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.73,0:11:52.60,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.15,0:11:55.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.31,0:11:57.40,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, after all...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.53,0:12:03.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.94,0:12:09.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, come to think of it, wasn't today the jump rope contest?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.02,0:12:10.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.32,0:12:14.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I screwed up...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:15.99,0:12:17.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How many?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.70,0:12:20.09,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,15 times.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.09,0:12:21.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.12,0:12:25.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What about backward-style jumping?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,203 times.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.71,0:12:33.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can jump like that?!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.51,0:12:35.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get first place for that?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.72,0:12:36.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:37.09,0:12:39.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here's my certificate.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.18,0:12:42.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You really did your best. This is fantastic.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:42.03,0:12:45.56,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But I know I could've done better with regular-style jumping rope...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.56,0:12:48.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, they only gave you one chance...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.48,0:12:49.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.94,0:12:54.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, you certainly learned to jump rope a lot.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.32,0:12:56.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know so, at least.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:57.86,0:12:58.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.82,0:13:01.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I lost weight!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.66,0:13:04.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.66,0:13:05.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.97,0:13:10.88,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are we almost there?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.42,0:13:13.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe 10 more minutes...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.17,0:13:15.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They'll want to see those wobbly front teeth.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.76,0:13:16.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:17.17,0:13:19.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do I have to tell you? Don't touch them if you can help it!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.94,0:13:22.60,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll show them how I can jump rope, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.60,0:13:23.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.35,0:13:26.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I bet my mom and dad will be surprised
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.81,0:13:29.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,to see how you've shot up since the last time.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.56,0:13:33.98,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'm taller than Auntie now.  {don't think it's been established what Rin calls her?}
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.98,0:13:36.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you're that tall yet.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to tell Grandpa, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.46,0:13:52.42,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're back!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:52.42,0:13:55.55,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rin-chan! I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.55,0:13:56.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.46,0:13:59.88,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Look how big you've gotten!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.89,Main Dialog,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Are you one of the taller kids in your class?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.89,0:14:02.93,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.93,0:14:05.97,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd called, I would've picked you up at the station!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin can walk 10 minutes!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:09.73,0:14:12.65,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Soon, you'll be taller than me!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.03,0:14:22.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kazumi!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.41,0:14:24.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yo. You're here early.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.49,0:14:26.87,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I just got here a little while ago.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.87,0:14:27.95,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Those clothes...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.95,0:14:30.33,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You used to wear them, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.26,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.83,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie sent them to me!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.38,0:14:37.05,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, show me your teeth.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.05,0:14:38.01,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.59,0:14:44.55,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Two of them in front are wobbly...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.55,0:14:46.85,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? It doesn't hurt?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.85,0:14:50.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes it hurts, but I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:50.48,0:14:51.81,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a pro, see?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.81,0:14:53.31,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:53.31,0:14:55.15,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there anything you can do for her?!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.15,0:14:56.77,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Her gums are turning red! {I assume she means gums and not the teeth}
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.77,0:14:58.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little bit...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:58.73,0:14:59.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And come to think of it, when I was a kid,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,you talked about pulling my loose teeth out with a thread!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.49,0:15:02.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A thread?!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.96,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my goodness! Did I?!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:05.95,0:15:08.33,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to make everything soft.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.33,0:15:09.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:13.58,0:15:15.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna have some freeze-dried tofu?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.00,0:15:15.96,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.96,0:15:18.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have boiled beans too, Auntie!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:18.25,0:15:19.46,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.47,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.22,0:15:29.60,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I like freeze-dried tofu!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.65,0:15:39.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did one come out?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.78,0:15:40.79,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.32,0:15:46.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.78,0:15:49.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Blood! Blood!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.12,0:15:50.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Tissue! Tissue!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.79,0:15:51.72,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.16,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, use this for now!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.16,0:15:55.67,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a dust cloth!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.17,0:16:02.05,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan has changed a lot.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.97,0:16:04.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.43,0:16:07.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This might just be the real Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.43,0:16:08.89,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:08.89,0:16:11.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So, you're getting married?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.27,0:16:13.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom was saying...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:13.48,0:16:14.52,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:14.52,0:16:18.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Good for you. She said he seemed like a nice guy.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.98,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:19.98,0:16:24.49,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,The only thing I don't agree with is that he wants to have a kid right away.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:24.49,0:16:26.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a good thing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:26.07,0:16:27.42,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:27.42,0:16:29.83,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be able to go out drinking or go to concerts
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.38,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,or go on trips or eat delicious food...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.70,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be able to do anything anymore!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:34.37,0:16:37.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you have to talk to your husband about that.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:37.21,0:16:39.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't know...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:39.71,0:16:42.00,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not into kids in the first place!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:42.00,0:16:45.31,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't want to become one of those pushy moms either!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:47.43,0:16:51.78,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure I could sacrifice myself to raise a kid...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:53.52,0:16:56.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I think you'd manage somehow.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.48,0:16:57.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you put your mind to it...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes you just have to manage...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.65,0:17:03.65,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Easy for you to say, big brother...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.65,0:17:05.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, maybe...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.61,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:08.91,0:17:15.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've never become a father or husband, let alone a mother.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.75,0:17:20.33,Main Dialog,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's burning...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:20.33,0:17:21.34,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:23.05,0:17:26.47,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,True, I don't have time to shop at my leisure,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:26.47,0:17:28.55,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,or chat with friends over coffee.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.55,0:17:32.26,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But my time at work is my own time...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.69,0:17:41.65,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,My time with my son is also my own time...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:41.65,0:17:42.79,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Precious time...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.19,0:17:44.94,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Other parents might look like it,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.65,Main Dialog,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,but I don't think they're doing anything special.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.32,0:17:53.20,Main Dialog,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,If you look around you, you'll see many mothers and fathers like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:58.58,0:17:59.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.83,0:18:02.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.44,0:18:27.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, you know what?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.82,0:18:33.49,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Some of my adult teeth are coming in.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.69,0:19:07.27,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Rin!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.11,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is sweat!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.16,0:19:16.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.08,0:19:20.51,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:21.41,0:19:22.97,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Say "cheese"!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:34.30,0:19:35.65,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That jar...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:36.35,0:19:38.53,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had it, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:41.22,0:19:42.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:04.33,0:20:06.35,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:06.35,0:20:09.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?! The other one's coming loose?!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.43,0:20:12.13,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mirror! Mirror!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:12.13,0:20:15.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I bet I'll still keep getting nervous and worked up
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.30,0:20:17.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,over minor stuff from here on out.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:18.14,0:20:21.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose it's the same way with those two.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:24.06,0:20:25.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:26.85,0:20:27.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:30.44,0:20:32.73,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look at this!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.90,0:20:39.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck? It's like you've got a cat's face!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:39.20,0:20:40.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:40.34,0:20:42.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Send a text to your parents' house!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:43.00,0:20:44.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You mean a photo?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:43.33,0:20:50.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, it seems like that smile will be my happiness from now on.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.05,0:20:45.21,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Yeah!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:50.84,0:20:53.13,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.13,0:20:55.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, open your mouth.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:59.64,0:21:02.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I suppose there's nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.08,0:22:47.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!!
